  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/mod-gallery/mdm4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></em></p><h1>現代裝飾</h1><h3>&nbsp;</h3><hr><h3>&nbsp;</h3><p>這是一個專注於將簡約現代風格內部裝潢帶入《Minecraft》的模組。它增加了各式各樣的家具與裝飾元素，讓你能夠打造出細緻且真實的空間，從溫馨小房間到完整風格的現代房屋一應俱全。</p><hr><h3><strong>特色</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><strong>多種房型的現代家具</strong></li>\n<li>精緻的<strong>室內配件</strong></li>\n<li>時尚的<strong>照明元素</strong></li>\n<li>專為<strong>寫實室內設計</strong>打造的方塊</li>\n</ul><hr><h3><br><br>你有想過這個模組還能加入什麼內容嗎？或者你發現了錯誤？加入我們的 Discord 並融入我們的社群吧！</h3><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrVTtKNRkn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://theme.zdassets.com/theme_assets/678183/cc59daa07820943e943c2fc283b9079d7003ff76.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"124\" height=\"24\"></a></p><p>如需更詳細資訊或支援，請前往我們的網站 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcookiecraftmods.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://cookiecraftmods.com</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcookiecraftmods.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/cookiecraftmods-logo-nobg.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/edm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/mod-bg/edm-bg.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"384\" height=\"192\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/builders-palette\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/mod-bg/bp-bg.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"384\" height=\"192\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmhouse-decorations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/mod-bg/fdm-bg.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"384\" height=\"192\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcookiecraftmods.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/mod-bg/CCM-FULL-BANNER-text.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"384\" height=\"192\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fZ8Z21OHRJY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"border:0px\" src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/kofi1.png?v=6\" alt=\"在 ko-fi.com 上請我喝咖啡\" height=\"36\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">以下是一些圖片：（來源 - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcookiecraftmods.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">cookiecraftmods.com</a>）</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/mod-bg/mdm-bg.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"457\" height=\"257\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/mdm-livingroom2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"457\" height=\"257\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/bathroom.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"457\" height=\"257\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/office-mdmxedm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"457\" height=\"257\"> （此處使用了 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcookiecraftmods.com%252fmods%252fedm%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">edm</a> 的元素）</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/terracemdm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"457\" height=\"257\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://cookiecraftmods.com/images/kitchenmdm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"457\" height=\"257\"></p>",
